WEBVTT

00:01:31.910 --> 00:01:34.080
Please rest as much as possible.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:40.510
I'm sure there are many things you can still protect with your right arm.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.860
You're right.

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:50.170
If what you told me is true, I will have to rethink this case from the start.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:50.920
Also,

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:56.440
I will not speak of your mother to anyone.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:57.440
I promise you.

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:02.400
But if you find it necessary, please talk about it.

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:26.370
It had been six days since that terrifying raid.

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:34.510
The Queen's life had been saved and she was on the road to recovery.

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:55.480
Standing here makes it feel like it was all a dream.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:24.240
So this is where you were, Erin.

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.740
Esal-sensei.

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:30.240
It's an invitation from the Queen.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:32.600
From the Queen?!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:38.960
She will be making her way down to the capital.

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:44.920
Before she does, she wants to invite you to a banquet for a meeting.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:54.590
They saw the beast-lord that never befriends humans fly with one in the sky.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:59.550
Since it's come down to this, we have no choice but to hear what she has to say.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:08.520
The Truth About the Queen

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:18.750
Man!  It's amazing how the little girl got invited to the Queen's banquet.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:26.200
Ani!  Ani!  What's dinner with the Queen like?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:30.300
An unbelievable feast, of course!

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:34.350
The bounty of the sea and the riches of the soil...

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:37.440
So much that you can't even finish!

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:40.210
Whole roasted shishi meat, too?

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.810
Forget shishi!

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:45.940
An entire roasted <i>cow!</i>

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:08.010
Um, how is your injury?

00:05:08.930 --> 00:05:11.370
The Queen is expecting you.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.190
Thank you.

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.740
I heard the story from Damiya.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:49.460
Thank you from the bottom of my heart for saving everyone's life.

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:50.870
You have my gratitude.

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:59.080
Since I'm on the road, forgive me for only being able to present you with such a small gift.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:03.600
Instead, I would ask to hear whatever you might request.

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:07.230
Your Highness, I...

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:08.800
You don't have to hesitate.

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:12.650
Your accomplishment was brilliant.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:16.120
My entire body shivered when I witnessed it.

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:42.290
It was a re-enactment of the tale of the gods.

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:52.280
<i>Luke!</i>

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.030
<i>Lilan?</i>

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.450
<i>Lilan!</i>

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:24.580
Tomorrow, the Queen will be returning to the capital.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:29.510
We would like you to come to the palace along with that beast-lord to act as her guardian.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:34.200
Even if the Grand Duke sends another batch of Touda,

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:37.430
there's nothing to fear if you're around.

00:07:39.820 --> 00:07:44.790
<i>If people find out that you can control beast-lords, you may be taken advantage of.</i>

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:49.020
<i>Luke!</i>

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:50.610
<i>Lilan!</i>

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:08.540
Your Highness, please excuse us for not taking Lilan to the capital.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:19.010
Erin, do you understand the meaning of the statement you just made?

00:08:19.010 --> 00:08:24.830
Your words can be taken as refusal to protect the Queen.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:30.920
I am fully aware of the meaning behind my statement.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:38.240
I'll pretend I didn't hear that <i>last</i> statement.

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:40.510
I'll now order you once again.

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:45.140
Protect Her Highness in her travel to the palace with that beast-lord.

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:50.880
I beg your mercy.  I cannot.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:58.910
Do you speak knowing that those words are treasonous and bring nothing but death upon you?

00:08:58.910 --> 00:08:59.740
Yes.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.960
This situation will involve more than just you.

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:19.240
The teachers at Kazalm will be prosecuted as well for leaving the care of a beast-lord to an individual who refused to protect the Queen's life.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:28.980
If Esal-sensei and others were to be prosecuted, then that would hurt me more than losing my own life.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:30.270
Still...

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:36.220
You may be able to gnaw at me with it.  However, you cannot make me obey!

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.250
You...

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:44.490
Why do you so strongly refuse to protect me?

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:49.150
I would explain the reason to Your Highness in private.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.780
You're saying that you can't trust me?

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:57.790
Your Highness said she would listen to any request I had.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:09:59.530
This is my request.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:03.280
Please ask your people to step outside.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:10.500
You're asking me to be alone with a person who refused to protect me?

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:15.300
Then please have the Sezan, Ial-sama, at your side.

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:20.070
You're saying you can trust Ial and not me?!

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:24.120
As blood kin of Her Highness, I more than anyone-

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:27.870
Damiya, take everyone with you and step outside.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:29.240
Your Highness...

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:47.300
She turned everything back?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:55.270
The messenger wasn't even allowed into the palace, and all the get-well gifts were turned down at that location.

00:10:56.060 --> 00:11:03.930
Seimiya-sama said they can't permit gifts provided by hands covered in blood to enter the sanctuary.

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:10.640
Put these back where they came from.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:13.840
It would aggravate my father's condition if he hears of this.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:14.940
Right away.

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:23.660
Does Seimiya-sama truly think we're behind this?

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:36.010
Speak, Erin.

00:11:36.010 --> 00:11:40.050
Why can you not protect me with that beast-lord?

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.780
Allow me to ask a question before that.

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:49.380
Wouldn't my refusal to protect your life using a beast-lord conform to the hidden truth behind the Beast-Lord Imperatives,

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:56.190
and if I were to speak more, wouldn't it align with your true intention?

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:59.360
"My true intention?"

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:08.550
What do you mean?  How is this related to the Beast-Lord Imperatives?

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:18.060
So you weren't aware of the hidden meaning behind the Beast-Lord Imperatives nor the history of the Founding Queen Je.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:25.820
If one obeys the Beast-Lord Imperatives and raises a beast-lord using benetrophic water and the mute whistle,

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:29.890
they do not fly nor will they bear young.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:33.620
Why do you think we would need to do such a thing?

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:43.920
The purpose of the Beast-Lord Imperatives is to prevent a repeat of the tragedy the Founding Queen Je experienced.

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:13.280
<i>The beast-lords and Touda went berserk with the blood.</i>

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:19.580
<i>They could no longer be stopped by the hands of people, and the massacre continued until the end came.</i>

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:24.590
<i>This is how the world which was prosperous upon Ephon Noha perished.</i>

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:29.510
<i>No country has been founded there since, and it is now referred to as the Cursed Land.</i>

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:35.390
<i>She flew over Ephon Noha and came to this world.</i>

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:38.810
<i>Her name was Je.</i>

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:43.400
<i>The First Queen of this Holy Kingdom of Ryoza.</i>

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:50.240
I heard this story from a man of the Mist People.

00:13:50.240 --> 00:13:55.950
The Mist People regret the sin they committed and even now continue their vigil.

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:59.360
Such disaster and destruction...

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:07.360
This is the reason why your ancestor Je left Ephon Noha and descended to Tahai Aze.

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:21.390
I never knew this...

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:25.350
And it's all because of those detestable Saigamul.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:32.320
Because of the fire they set on the palace, my mother and grandmother passed away.

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:37.020
I had to take the throne of the Queen at the age of five.

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:44.870
I sat on the throne without knowing the story that had been passed down over 300 years though the generations...

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:50.920
Your Highness.

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:53.850
You needn't worry.

00:14:56.760 --> 00:15:04.800
My ancestor was not a god, but merely a criminal...

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:20.030
I do not want to keep Lilan confined in a small cage to prevent disaster, when I do not even know if it would come to pass.

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:29.750
But if Lilan and I turn into the cause of disaster like everyone fears,

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:31.880
when that happens,

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:37.970
I should be the only one prosecuted, and I will gladly give my life for it.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:45.590
If everything can be prevented by my death,

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:49.800
then I can follow my beliefs until the end.

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:05.580
My mother was of the Mist People.

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:11.240
But she met my father, who was a Touda breeder, and parted with the Mist People's way of life.

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:20.180
However, my father died young, so Mom and I lived alone in a village of Touda breeders.

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:30.770
She was of the Mist People, but she was an excellent beastinarian who was placed in charge of taking care of Touda.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:40.700
However, there were times when she had a forlorn face when watching over the domesticated Touda.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:50.040
One day, all the Kiba that were kept at the village died, and she was isolated as the one responsible.

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:56.460
She was put to death, her sentence being to be eaten alive by wild Touda.

00:16:58.590 --> 00:17:04.720
Then, in order to protect me, she used a Renditioner's skill to save me.

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:16.180
Mom died in order to abide by the code, but in the end, she disobeyed it to save my life.

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:22.740
That's why I don't want to die bound by codes, for Lilan's sake, too.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:32.000
You're strong.  Very strong.

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:41.050
Thank you.  I'm thankful that you shared your secrets with me.

00:17:41.050 --> 00:17:43.180
I understand how you feel.

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:48.180
I'll void the request I made to have you protect me on the way to the capital.

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:52.090
Thank you very much!

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:56.610
But instead, may I come visit again?

00:17:57.270 --> 00:18:00.060
I'd like to see those beautiful beast-lords again.

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:02.530
Please do!

00:18:21.090 --> 00:18:26.680
You wasted your life by becoming my shield, did you not?

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:33.850
With all due respect, please do not speak such words ever again.

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:40.930
No matter what your ancestor may have done, you yourself are none other than the current Queen of this kingdom.

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:48.940
If Erin's story is true, then all the past Queens knew the history.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:54.370
They fulfilled their roles as Queen knowing that history.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:59.860
I am your shield, but you are the shield of this country.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:07.340
If you do not remain as a strong shield, this country will face great destruction.

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:14.140
You are truly a steady man.

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:20.980
Steady enough that you could catch fish, even if the water were murky.

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:30.020
Your Highness, there is something I would like to inform you of also, since there are no prying ears at this moment.

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:36.690
I believe this assault was performed by a third party who pretended to be the Grand Duke's army.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:45.220
There are people who hide in the dark, trying to gain control of this country.

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:28.970
Your Highness.

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:30.800
Do not worry.

00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:33.390
I am Harumiya, the Queen.

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:36.600
I will be the one to protect this country for as long as I live.

00:20:37.890 --> 00:20:41.940
As soon as I return to the capital, I will correct all the wrongdoings.

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:42.810
Ma'am.

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:56.790
Ani, no sleep talking.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.080
Oh, sorry.

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:01.460
Hey!  You're the one that needs to wake up!

00:21:05.710 --> 00:21:14.550
Lilan, we might become the focus of conversations for a while, but the Queen understood the story.

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:16.850
What a relief.

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:17.720
Erin.

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:22.220
Esal-sensei!  Good morning!

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:30.890
The Queen has passed away.

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:39.330
Right when she was about to arrive at the palace,

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:48.800
she suddenly collapsed.

00:21:49.380 --> 00:21:55.850
There was bleeding in her head that her doctors couldn't notice, and it had spread slowly.

00:21:57.060 --> 00:22:01.380
In the end, she never woke up and she passed away last night.

00:22:10.610 --> 00:22:13.930
The sudden death of the Queen, Harumiya.

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:18.950
It was in that moment that her hopes died as well.

00:22:19.740 --> 00:22:25.500
Hearing the news, Erin could only stand there, stunned.

00:24:01.490 --> 00:24:05.330
Seimiya, cry all you want.

00:24:05.330 --> 00:24:12.330
You may be the Queen to the citizens, but you're still the cute Seimiya to me, no matter what.

00:24:12.330 --> 00:24:17.550
And choose the man you wish to live with.

00:24:17.550 --> 00:24:17.560
You should be able to tell who the man
that loves you the most is.
And choose the man you wish to live with.

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:21.880
You should be able to tell who the man
that loves you the most is.

00:24:21.880 --> 00:24:24.930
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Seimiya's Tears.

00:24:25.050 --> 00:26:00.070
Seimiya's Tears
